{"id":1160502,"name":"嘟嘟·审查Ⅱ","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"嘟嘟·审查Ⅱ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1160502]}],"trial":{"trial_id":160502,"stage":"阶段2","unlock_time":"2023-03-07 14:00:00","diary1":"距离上次审查仅仅几天之后，嘟嘟突然神色焦急地闯进了你的办公室。\n　　她带来了一则爆炸性的消息——流民寨里居然有人正掌握着帕尔马的情报。","diary2":"所谓”帕尔马“的情报果然只是嘟嘟为了回流民寨看望病重的老太太而编造出的借口，但你在嘟嘟的带领下与流民寨众居民进行互动，近距离观察了那里风土人情，也算是别有收获。\n　　然而就在即将打道回府之际，你们竟从当地的老者那里得知令老太太一直念念不忘的是某样叫“帕拉马”的东西。而一切的真相，似乎就藏在一栋曾经遭过灾的废楼之中。","evidence":[{"ID":260315,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260316,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260502001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260502002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260502003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260502004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260502005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260502006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260502007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260502008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260502009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260502010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260502011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260502012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260502013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":3,"dialogue_id":260502014,"next":[15]},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260502015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260502016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260502017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260502018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260502019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260502020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260502021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260502022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260502023,"next":null},{"step":24,"course":2,"dialo